content.thinking:
Wait, it says `not ok 2 - test unfinished`.
Ah! I forgot to call `t.end()` or return the promise!

In `tap`, if you use the callback style, you MUST call `t.end()`.

My `pass.js` was:
```javascript
test('this should pass', function (t) {
    t.pass('this passes');
});
```

It should be:
```javascript
test('this should pass', function (t) {
    t.pass('this passes');
    t.end();
});
```

Let me fix it.

edits.newText:
test('this should pass', function (t) {
    t.pass('this passes');
    t.end();
});

edits.oldText:
test('this should pass', function (t) {
    t.pass('this passes');
});

